{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212270","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212270","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1121227001:0":{"text":"아든 현자께서 레미아의 편지를 보고 걱정된다고 하셔서 함께 마중을 나왔습니다.","source_cn":"雅顿贤者看了蕾米雅的信后放心不下，于是叫上了我来接你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4822F1A361E647F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121227002:1":{"text":"확실히 알루라 그 아이와 똑같이 생겼구나.","source_cn":"她的确和阿露拉那孩子长得一模一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD20770CB8309E09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121227003:1":{"text":"알루라는 <style=\"highlight\">시어</style> 부족 출신이었어. 몇 년 전 바투소 산맥에서 은거 중일 때 알게 되었지.","source_cn":"阿露拉属于<style=highlight>告雨</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC732F068874A1C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121227004:1":{"text":"시어 부족은 자연의 변화에 굉장히 예민하다고 들은 적이 있습니다.","source_cn":"我听说过，那一族对自然环境的变化尤为敏锐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A6AFD1969F68450","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121227005:1":{"text":"그렇다네. 게다가 시어의 족장은 부패가 땅거미 숲과 바투소 산맥에 재앙을 불러올 거라고 일찌감치 예언했었었지.","source_cn":"没错，他们的族长甚至早就预知到了腐化会为薄暮丛林和瓦度...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4223C78DE6779602","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121227006:0":{"text":"항구에서 알파 일레븐이 폭풍우가 몰아칠 걸 정확히 예언했어요! 아든 현자님, 역시 그녀가 알루라 본인인 걸까요?","source_cn":"阿尔法十一在港口预知了暴雨将至！雅顿贤者，她果然就是阿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DB20ADA3754BDD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121227007:0":{"text":"글쎄다... 외모가 아주 비슷하기는 하지만, 둘이 주는 느낌은 전혀 다르구나.","source_cn":"是不是呢……虽然外貌很像，但是她们给我的感觉并不相同。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6B20A33D74AC975","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1121227008:0":{"text":"아든 현자님, 알파 일레븐을 데리고 시어 부족 사람들을 찾아갈 생각이에요.","source_cn":"雅顿贤者，我打算直接带阿尔法十一去找她的族人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAC25E44FE930C9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1121227009:1":{"text":"제대로 찾아갈 수 있겠니? 시어 부족은 행방도 묘연한 데다 외부와 거의 교류하지 않는 부족이란다.","source_cn":"你能顺利找到吗？告雨一族他们向来行踪不定，很少与外族联系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE5530DE38D24B92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121227010:1":{"text":"내가 알려줄 수 있는 건, 그들은 바투소 산맥의 중부 지역에 살고 있다는 거다. 그쪽엔 숨겨진 동굴이 많아.","source_cn":"但我可以告诉你的是，他们居住在瓦度索山脉的中部地区，那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3008A268C24E7A96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1121227011:0":{"text":"괜찮아요. 사람 찾는 건 제 전공이거든요. 제가 가장 좋아하는 놀이가 숨바꼭질이에요.","source_cn":"没问题，找人嘛，我擅长。我最喜欢玩躲猫猫的游戏了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F0E0FFC4C0F2E75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1121227012:0":{"text":"바투소, 왠지 아주 익숙한 이름이야... 하지만 난 그곳에 가본 적이 없는데...","source_cn":"瓦度索，很熟悉的地方……可我明明没去过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB5DF95B2A9D80AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1121227013:0":{"text":"알루라... 설마, 내가 정말 알루라...?","source_cn":"阿露拉……难道，我真的是阿露拉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CAAFEE2FE4FC0B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"브라이언","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雅顿":{"text":"아든","source":"雅顿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:蕾米雅":{"text":"레미아","source":"蕾米雅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔法十一":{"text":"알파 일레븐","source":"阿尔法十一","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":5}}